# Seal the chamber and stop every pump
# Closes the gate valve, turns the turbo pump off and waits for it to stop turning.
# The controller does not report its speed, so formsLAB counts it as turning for
# turbo_spindown_s after it was last on (tvac_bench.json; 30 minutes unless the
# turbo's manual says otherwise), and the vacuum pump backs it through the foreline
# meanwhile. Then closes the foreline and vacuum valves and stops the vacuum pump.
# Put it after highvac and before vent.
block seal chamber
load rLACO

hvc gate close
hvc turbo off
until TurboSpinning = false
hvc foreline close
hvc stop
